{
  "title": "A notes API with net/http",
  "lesson": "go/07-modules-testing-http",
  "kind": "http",
  "lang": "go",
  "edit": [
    "main.go"
  ],
  "start": [
    "go",
    "run",
    "main.go"
  ],
  "start_timeout": 180,
  "timeout": 20,
  "requests": [
    {
      "name": "GET /notes starts as an empty list",
      "path": "/notes",
      "status": 200,
      "json": [],
      "header": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST /notes creates a note and answers 201",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/notes",
      "body": {
        "text": "buy milk"
      },
      "status": 201,
      "json": {
        "id": 1,
        "text": "buy milk"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "the next note gets the next id",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/notes",
      "body": {
        "text": "walk the dog"
      },
      "status": 201,
      "json": {
        "id": 2,
        "text": "walk the dog"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST with an empty text answers 400",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/notes",
      "body": {
        "text": ""
      },
      "status": 400,
      "json": {
        "error": "text is required"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "POST with invalid JSON answers 400",
      "method": "POST",
      "path": "/notes",
      "raw": "{not json",
      "headers": {
        "Content-Type": "application/json"
      },
      "status": 400,
      "json": {
        "error": "invalid JSON"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "GET /notes lists both",
      "path": "/notes",
      "status": 200,
      "json": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "text": "buy milk"
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "text": "walk the dog"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "GET /notes/2 returns one note",
      "path": "/notes/2",
      "status": 200,
      "json": {
        "id": 2,
        "text": "walk the dog"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "GET /notes/99 answers 404",
      "path": "/notes/99",
      "status": 404,
      "json": {
        "error": "not found"
      }
    },
    {
      "name": "DELETE /notes/1 answers 204",
      "method": "DELETE",
      "path": "/notes/1",
      "status": 204
    },
    {
      "name": "the deleted note is gone",
      "path": "/notes/1",
      "status": 404
    },
    {
      "name": "the other note is still there",
      "path": "/notes",
      "status": 200,
      "json": [
        {
          "id": 2,
          "text": "walk the dog"
        }
      ]
    }
  ],
  "hints": [
    "Lock the mutex in every handler that reads or writes the notes: mu.Lock() then defer mu.Unlock().",
    "POST: decode into a struct with a Text field. On a decode error answer 400 with {\"error\": \"invalid JSON\"} and return.",
    "The id in the path: id, err := strconv.Atoi(r.PathValue(\"id\")). Then look for the note with that ID.",
    "DELETE: build a new slice without that note, then w.WriteHeader(http.StatusNoContent)."
  ]
}
